name: issue
description: File a problem in the Issues section of TASKS.md, or mark an existing issue fixed. Use when the user says "log an issue", "this is a bug" or "mark it fixed".
---

# Filing issues

- New problem: add `- [open] description (reported by)` at the end of "## Issues" in TASKS.md. Describe what happens and how to reproduce it in a sentence or two; do not guess at causes. Write "reported by the agent" for problems you found yourself.
- If the problem is already listed, add to that entry instead of filing it twice.
- Once fixed: change [open] to [fixed] and add the version in the parentheses. If the developer needs an explanation, add it on an indented line below.
- Only touch the Issues section; leave the rest of TASKS.md alone.
